{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05445","headline":"铜雀妓 · 袁晖","name":"铜雀妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君爱本相饶，从来似舞腰。\n那堪攀玉座，肠断望陵朝。\n怨着情无主，哀凝曲不调。\n况临松日暮，悲吹坐萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁晖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}